<title>USA: LITTON PRC DIVISION GETS NAVY CONTRACT.</title>
<headline>LITTON PRC DIVISION GETS NAVY CONTRACT.</headline>
<dateline>WOODLAND HILLS, Calif 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Litton Industries Inc's PRC unit is participating on a team led by Lucent Technologies, one of two winners of the Naval Information Management Center's $2.9 billion contract for Voice, Video and Data (ViViD).</p>
<p>Litton's portion, which PRC expects to total more than $150 million in revenue, is to provide telecommunication and engineering support services to virtually every U.S. Navy base and station in the world.</p>
<p>The U.S. Navy contract was awarded for a 10-year period to Lucent Technologies and GTE.</p>
